  "brief": {
    "zh": "带上上层矿样和深层矿样，从西南升降机撤离。矿井的五个振动器会在第 5、13、22、32、45 回合各震一次。震动只持续一回合，会波及振动器和上下左右相邻的一格。矿车在深层长廊来回行驶。限 69 回合。",
    "en": "Take a sample from the upper shaft and one from the deep shaft to the southwest lift. The five tremor cells pulse once each on turns 5, 13, 22, 32 and 45. A pulse lasts one turn and reaches the cell and its four immediate neighbors. An ore cart shuttles along the deep tunnel. You have 69 turns."
  },
